{"ID":"20240314091953-txa1sb1","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091953-txa1sb1","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091953-txa1sb1\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422163841-nx41mii\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422163850-zivo84s\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:400,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422163850-pxfgw8a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:81,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:81\u0026#125;","title":"【越婢加术汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422163850"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422163841-nx41mii","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422163841-nx41mii","updated":"20240422163841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"里水者，一身面目黄肿，其脉沉，小便不利，故令病水；假令小便自利，此亡津液，故令渴，越婢加术汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422163841-pt64274","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163841-pt64274","updated":"20240422163841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个条辨讲的越婢汤加白术，大家看哦，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"里水，就是水更深一层在里面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一身面目黄肿，其脉沉"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，代表病在里，摸他的脉，沉脉代表里面的哦，病在里面，小便不利，因为水积在里面啦，所以这个是全身水肿，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这种情形如果小便自利的话，代表说这个水有地方宣泄，就是会亡津液哦"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以病人就会有口渴的现象。"}]},{"ID":"20240422163841-yqvptxv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163841-yqvptxv","updated":"20240422163841"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"越婢加术汤很简单的...诸位这样子看记不得，只要记得我讲的话："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"越婢汤在使用的时候病人一定是有汗的，有汗而且喘气，而且有发高烧"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"加术就是，因为本身他还有湿在身体里面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以有湿家，本身就素有湿。所以病人，你怎么知道他有湿呢？很简单，常常，平常没事的时候，肌肉关节就比较酸痛，那就是汗水没有透发，所以我们常常说，冷气间不要呆，那你有时候呆在冷气间没有办法啊，那你有时候，每个礼拜天，或者平常每个晚上去做做易筋经或者跑步，让汗出来一下，让它排出来肌肉就不会那么酸，否则的话，你肌肉关节里面常常有酸酸的感觉的话，都是代表就是有湿在里面，那你如果有汗又有渴，这个是越婢汤症，越婢汤症加白术。这是里水，所以当你看到病人水肿的时候，又有汗又口渴，小便又不利，肌肉又酸痛，已经是越婢汤加白术了哦。"}]},{"ID":"20240422163849-d7bjh7j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163849-d7bjh7j"}},{"ID":"20240422163850-pxfgw8a","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422163850-pxfgw8a","updated":"20240422163850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"里水，越婢加术汤主之，甘草麻黄汤亦主之。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"里水者，一身面目洪肿，其脉沉，小便不利，无渴，故令病水，甘草麻黄汤主之；假令小便自利，此亡津液，故令渴也，越婢加术汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422163850-bjk2q8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163850-bjk2q8z","updated":"20240422163850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再如果，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"刚刚的皮水没有被治好，这个水再往深入进去以后，就变成里水，水更深入，里水出现的时候，是越婢加术汤，还有呢甘草麻黄汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422163850-1xyh0m0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163850-1xyh0m0","updated":"20240422163850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你看“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"里水者"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"什么叫里水，全身水肿面目水肿，脉是沉的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。你如果脉是浮的，小便不利，口渴，五苓散症对不对？诸位应变就可以很快。那到美国来的时候，你放心，我不会问你用什么汤方，我会开给你看，所以你们安心好了。“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"面目洪肿"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，全身肿，对不对。脉是沉的，是不是代表是里？就是代表里。“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"小便不利"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"全身肿了，小便不利，告诉你我就是水病嘛，积水嘛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这个病人没有渴，所以病水。"}]},{"ID":"20240422163850-9nnbbx6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163850-9nnbbx6","updated":"20240422163850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个甘草麻黄汤，没有其他的功能，就是要发水，发汗。我们经方里面，很多地方两味药，配合甘草在用：大黄甘草汤、桂枝甘草汤、茯苓甘草汤、甘草麻黄汤，都是两味药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。当你用这味药，甘草跟另外一味药在合并使用的时候，有剂量上的问题，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果你麻黄用二，甘草就用一，所以一定是二比一"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。比如大黄甘草汤，就是大黄二，甘草一。桂枝甘草汤，动悸嘛，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"心动悸，那就桂枝二，甘草一"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这样了解我的意思吧。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果是脐下悸的话，茯苓二，甘草一"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。诸如此类的，一定是甘草的两倍。那如果说个子比较大用四，甘草就用二，甘草麻黄汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240422163850-zivo84s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422163850-zivo84s","updated":"20240422163850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那发汗的时候，吃下去一定会发汗，汗一出来，病人水就退掉了。那如果说病人“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"小便自利此亡津液，故令渴也"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个本身面目有水肿，结果呢小便不利的时候无渴，用发汗的方法"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果病人小便呢很顺，这是津液亡了，所以令渴，这个时候用越婢加术汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。白术呢为什么说小便自利哦？因为病人呢在亡津液的时候，津液不够的时候。我们知道身上津液的来源呢，肺主的是皮毛，所以皮肤把全身上下包含在一起，如果是有全身性的水肿的时候，小便很利，小便不利呢？发汗就好了，小便很利的话我们就要把肺里面的津液补回去就好了。就是这两个症，只有两个处方而已。"}]}]}